{"id":"nelegko","lemma":"нелегко","pos":"adv","rank":1105,"glosses":["not easily, with difficulty"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a3/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%B3%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%B3%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я знаю, это нелегко.","en":"I know it's not easy.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Тебя нелегко найти.","en":"You're not easy to find.","words":[{"g":"you","l":"ты"},null,{"g":"to find"}]},{"text":"Для меня это будет нелегко.","en":"It's not going to be easy for me.","words":[{"g":"for"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Это было нелегко сделать.","en":"It wasn't easy to do.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283148","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"to make, to do"}]},{"text":"Убедить его было нелегко.","en":"It was not easy to convince him.","words":[{"g":"to convince"},{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]}]}